 "description": "CloseCapTableRound PERMANENTLY closes the round: runs the calc engine, persists the SAFE conversions + ownership snapshots, and flips the round to CLOSED. This is the action for \"close the round\", \"make it permanent\", or \"finalize the round\" \u2014 it CANNOT be undone and writes the cap-table of record, so confirm with the user first. To only estimate the outcome without closing, use PreviewCloseCapTableRound.",
